'''Romero and Juliette''' is a [[Quest]] in [[The Park]], telling the story of the love between {{NPCSprite|Romero}} and {{NPCSprite|Juliette}}.

== Quest Summary ==
To start the quest, you must speak with Juliette (Romero won't appear otherwise). The rest of the quest requires you to find Romero in separate locations and fetching items for him, which you will give to Juliette each time. Be warned that some of the required items are expensive and should only be finished in the late or end game.

As of v0.19.5 update, the quest requires at least {{Skill|Combat|22}} to complete.

For further details on each step, have a look below the table.

Each step of the quest gives an upgraded form of the {{Item|Ring of Love}}, which gives a percentage chance to deal {{Stat|Damage|+100%}}. For brevity, the table will only list the odds.

'''Note''': Required items will be consumed, except for the Tuxedo and any gear used to reach enough {{stat|int}} for the 7th step.

